#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Temporary SigNoz collector recovery watchdog.

Restarts the SigNoz OTel collector Deployment when log ingestion into
ClickHouse has been stale for several consecutive checks, and records why.
This is an operational mitigation for an unexplained collector stall, not a
fix for it. See roles/signoz_k8s/README.md.

Commands:
  check       one watchdog cycle (run by the systemd timer)
  checkmk     print the Checkmk local check line from the saved state
  status      print the saved state and maintenance inhibit as JSON
  inhibit     suspend restarts for a period (--duration, --reason)
  uninhibit   end a maintenance inhibit
  reset       close the circuit breaker (--clear-history also forgets
              restart attempts, so cooldown and budget start over)

Only the Python standard library is used. Settings come from a JSON file
written by Ansible (--config).
"""

